Subject: Platform release 4.2 is now live
Date: Mon, 12 May 2025 09:00:00 +0000
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"

Hi all,

Platform release 4.2 went out to production this morning. The headline change
is a faster deployment pipeline: a full deploy now takes about four minutes,
down from eleven.

This release also adds a startup check that verifies database credentials
before a service accepts traffic, which closes the gap identified in incident
INC-2024-017.

If you see anything unexpected, open an incident and post in the engineering
channel.

Thanks,
The Release Team
